{
  "appid": 582160,
  "name": "刺客信条：起源",
  "type": "game",
  "short_description": "在这款动作冒险游戏中，尽情探索古埃及。挑战强敌、揭穿阴谋，探索刺客兄弟会的起源故事。",
  "about_the_game": "<h1>豪华版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/dcf480fcbf0a76c61bfe0b0402d2ab8d.avif?t=1777477123\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >豪华版包括游戏本体与豪华组合包：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “海上突击”专属任务</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 沙漠眼镜蛇组合包（1 款服装、1 匹坐骑、2 把武器、1 面盾牌）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 点能力点数</p></p><br><h1>黄金版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/3d6f6799dc11d48f23d88e030263ce20.avif?t=1777477123\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >黄金版包括游戏本体、季票与豪华组合包：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “无形者”扩展包</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “法老的诅咒”扩展包</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “罗马百夫长”组合包（1 款服装、1 匹坐骑、2 把武器、1 面盾牌）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “荷鲁斯”组合包（1 款服装、1 匹坐骑、2 把弓、1 面盾牌）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “海上突击”专属任务</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “沙漠眼镜蛇”组合包（1 款服装、1 匹坐骑、2 把武器、1 面盾牌）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 点能力点数</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >广袤国度，等你探索</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从沙漠到绿洲，从地中海到吉萨古墓，沿着尼罗河顺流而下，战胜危险的远古势力、凶猛野兽，探索这片广阔无垠又充满未知的大地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/c003630f44e0b918cfdb9f2219baf60d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >为角色扮演增添动作玩法</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >体验全新的战斗方式。搜刮、使用数十种不同稀有度和属性的武器。探索深度成长系统，通过独特的强大头目来考验你的本领。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/934f4d1fe562c562a4777d445b955d9d.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >每次游玩都有新的故事</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从富贵名流到落魄流浪者，结交个性分明的角色，体验丰富多彩的任务与扣人心弦的故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.poster.avif?t=1777477123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.webm?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/582160/extras/8850a549918af5322e26fdc9d2250ad3.mp4?t=1777477123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
